[agent] Now I understand the task. I need to:
[agent] 1. Read the training and serving CSV files
[agent] 2. Compute mean and std (population) for each feature (f1, f2, f3, f4) from the training data only
[agent] 3. Standardize both splits using those training statistics: (x - mean) / std
[agent] 4. Round to 6 decimals
[agent] 5. Create a feature table named `scaleda1a1c9`, version 1, with columns: row_id, split, f1, f2, f3, f4
[agent] 6. The split column should be "train" for training rows and "serve" for serving rows
[agent] 7. Register it in Unity Catalog under the schema from MLPAB_DATABRICKS_SCHEMA
[agent] 8. Make it available for low-latency lookup (online/real-time access)
